9357942133_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Fd3BVyKDBnoQ7kNvwE_D5dT&_nc_oc=Adqv3Y_EzM8CnT5gr8w4xryHLQphKkMt49aIuAGerNWCZyOLiy4y9CKK_mp8p8tsDi4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af7TqScV6zaZ4iF4ETQjFZB5rn868gBsluM8cArvWnoYLQ&oe=6A0DAD04"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Controls and Wiring", "keywords": ["control", "wiring", "vr", "immerselearn"], "long_description": "Controls and Wiring is an immersive VR training application that enables learners to develop real-world skills in electrical control systems, circuit wiring, and component integration. Through interactive simulations, users practice identifying components, interpreting wiring diagrams, assembling control circuits, and troubleshooting faults in a safe, virtual environment.\n\nThis application is a core component of the Immerse Learn Controls and Wiring micro-credential program, designed to enhance technical proficiency through experiential learning. Learners gain confidence by performing tasks that mirror real industry scenarios, improving both accuracy and decision-making skills.\n\nPlease note: This app is not a standalone product. Access is strictly limited to individuals enrolled in the Immerse Learn Controls and Wiring micro-credential program, where it is used for guided, hands-on training.", "short_description": "Controls and Wiring is a VR training application designed to build practical skills in electrical control systems and wiring. Part of the Immerse Learn Controls and Wiring micro-credential program, this app provides hands-on, immersive learning experiences. Access is exclusively available to learners enrolled in the program."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://immerselearn.com/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "ImmerseLearn", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://immerselearn.com/", "category": null, "comfort_r